    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637650/extras/a38d867fed35e9cee5b26057565fad16.poster.avif?t=1749082178\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637650/extras/a38d867fed35e9cee5b26057565fad16.webm?t=1749082178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637650/extras/a38d867fed35e9cee5b26057565fad16.mp4?t=1749082178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eli, a Climber living in the ruins of Castle Raen, is forced to embark on a dangerous journey down Mount Gail. Experience an unforgettable adventure as he struggles to navigate the harsh realities of this broken world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637650/extras/13269be3527c67e95390ac7e10acad8c.poster.avif?t=1749082178\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637650/extras/13269be3527c67e95390ac7e10acad8c.webm?t=1749082178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637650/extras/13269be3527c67e95390ac7e10acad8c.mp4?t=1749082178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master your Timing</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make quick decisions, chaining movements together with precision to traverse the dangerous landscapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637650/extras/b9acad01722765d3ddfc88f75baf4210.poster.avif?t=1749082178\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637650/extras/b9acad01722765d3ddfc88f75baf4210.webm?t=1749082178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637650/extras/b9acad01722765d3ddfc88f75baf4210.mp4?t=1749082178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use Your Environment</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve complex puzzles, manipulate your environment, and utilize objects you find to open new pathways forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637650/extras/8de5ade10fd43001ef8274e461ced40b.poster.avif?t=1749082178\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637650/extras/8de5ade10fd43001ef8274e461ced40b.webm?t=1749082178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637650/extras/8de5ade10fd43001ef8274e461ced40b.mp4?t=1749082178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Don't Fall&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can only hold on for so long.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637650/extras/a38d867fed35e9cee5b26057565fad16.poster.avif?t=1749082178\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637650/extras/a38d867fed35e9cee5b26057565fad16.webm?t=1749082178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637650/extras/a38d867fed35e9cee5b26057565fad16.mp4?t=1749082178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eli, a Climber living in the ruins of Castle Raen, is forced to embark on a dangerous journey down Mount Gail. Experience an unforgettable adventure as he struggles to navigate the harsh realities of this broken world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637650/extras/13269be3527c67e95390ac7e10acad8c.poster.avif?t=1749082178\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637650/extras/13269be3527c67e95390ac7e10acad8c.webm?t=1749082178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637650/extras/13269be3527c67e95390ac7e10acad8c.mp4?t=1749082178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master your Timing</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make quick decisions, chaining movements together with precision to traverse the dangerous landscapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637650/extras/b9acad01722765d3ddfc88f75baf4210.poster.avif?t=1749082178\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637650/extras/b9acad01722765d3ddfc88f75baf4210.webm?t=1749082178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637650/extras/b9acad01722765d3ddfc88f75baf4210.mp4?t=1749082178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use Your Environment</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve complex puzzles, manipulate your environment, and utilize objects you find to open new pathways forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637650/extras/8de5ade10fd43001ef8274e461ced40b.poster.avif?t=1749082178\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637650/extras/8de5ade10fd43001ef8274e461ced40b.webm?t=1749082178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637650/extras/8de5ade10fd43001ef8274e461ced40b.mp4?t=1749082178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Don't Fall&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can only hold on for so long.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
